#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:1
msgid "战⽃体验"
msgstr "Battle Experience"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:3
msgid "作者"
msgstr "Author"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;建建"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Jianjian"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:7
msgid "⽅案1：主要关注技能选择和1V1对战体验"
msgstr "Plan 1: Focused on Skill Selection and 1v1 Combat Experience"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:9
msgid "技能有⽐较⻓的伤害时间和⽐较⼤的伤害范围，玩家主要关注选择合适的技能"
msgstr "Skills have relatively long damage durations and large damage areas; players primarily focus on choosing appropriate skills"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:10
msgid "技能属性"
msgstr "Skill Attributes"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:11
msgid "分类。⼀共有4类（暂时成为ABCD），每类有N种不同技能。同类技能对应的⻆⾊动画都相同（特效和颜⾊可能不同）"
msgstr "Categories. There are 4 types (temporarily named ABCD), each with N different skills. Skills of the same type share the same character animations (effects and colors may differ)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:12
msgid "伤害值"
msgstr "Damage Value"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:13
msgid "伤害时间（包括开始时间点和结束时间点）"
msgstr "Damage Duration (including start and end time points)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:14
msgid "伤害范围（⼀个可以运动的⻓⽅体）"
msgstr "Damage Range (a movable rectangular cuboid)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:15
msgid "冷却时间"
msgstr "Cooldown Time"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:16
msgid "消耗能量或者增加能量"
msgstr "Energy Cost or Energy Gain"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:17
msgid "效果1"
msgstr "Effect 1"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:18
msgid "效果2"
msgstr "Effect 2"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:19
msgid "2个技能碰撞时，其碰撞结果为"
msgstr "When 2 skills collide, the collision result is"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:20
msgid "A遇到B（或者B遇到C，C遇到D）：A克制B。触发A的效果1，⽐如把被克制的⼀⽅debuff或者打晕。"
msgstr "A meets B (or B meets C, C meets D): A counters B. Triggers A's Effect 1, such as applying a Debuff or stunning the countered side."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:21
msgid "A遇到A（或者B遇到B）：平局。没有⻆⾊受到debuff。"
msgstr "A meets A (or B meets B): Draw. No character receives a Debuff."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:22
msgid "A遇到C（或者B遇到D）：平局，没有⻆⾊受到debuff。触发A和C的效果2，⽐如A是恢复能量，C是回⾎。"
msgstr "A meets C (or B meets D): Draw, no character receives a Debuff. Triggers A and C's Effect 2, such as A restoring energy and C recovering HP."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:23
msgid "⻆⾊状态"
msgstr "Character State"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:24
msgid "每名⻆⾊每个时刻都处于⼀个状态"
msgstr "Each character is in one state at any given moment"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:25
msgid "每隔N秒，状态随机改变⼀次"
msgstr "Every N seconds, the state changes randomly once"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:26
msgid "状态⼀共有4种（ABCD），和技能的4类对应。⻆⾊打出和状态同类的技能时，可以减少消耗或者加强技能。"
msgstr "There are 4 states (ABCD) corresponding to the 4 skill categories. When a character uses a skill of the same type as their current state, the cost is reduced or the skill is enhanced."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:27
msgid "技能选择："
msgstr "Skill Selection:"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:28
msgid "每名⻆⾊选择4个技能，每类都需要选择1种"
msgstr "Each character selects 4 skills, one from each category"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:30
msgid "方案2：类似传统格⽃游戏"
msgstr "Plan 2: Similar to Traditional Fighting Games"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:32
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;存在招式：攻击、防御、投技"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Moves include: Attack, Defense, Throw"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:34
msgid "方案3：关注⻆⾊的连招和配合"
msgstr "Plan 3: Focused on Character Combos and Coordination"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:36
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;待补充。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;To be supplemented."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:38
msgid "方案4：格⽃改版"
msgstr "Plan 4: Fighting Game Revision"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:40
msgid "体验"
msgstr "Experience"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:42
msgid "节奏更慢的格⽃"
msgstr "Slower-paced fighting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:43
msgid "仍然可以把别⼈打⻜、倒地，仍然有克制关系"
msgstr "Can still knock opponents away and knock them down; counter relationships still exist"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:44
msgid "打⻜倒地等状态切换是⼀个更⾼层次的⽬标，有⼀定缓冲"
msgstr "State transitions like being knocked away or knocked down are higher-level objectives with some buffer"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:45
msgid "技能克制"
msgstr "Skill Counters"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:46
msgid "出招时间：每次出招有准备时间，在这个时间内受到伤害增加。这样根据伤害时间范围，就有⽐较简单的克制关系。"
msgstr "Casting time: Each skill has a preparation time during which damage taken is increased. Based on damage timing and range, this creates a simple counter relationship."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:47
msgid "属性"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:49
msgid "规则"
msgstr "Rules"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:51
msgid "⻆⾊基于元素、技能克制关系放技能"
msgstr "Characters cast skills based on elemental and skill counter relationships"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:52
msgid "每个⻆⾊、敌⼈都有护盾条，攻击的时候先扣护盾条"
msgstr "Each character and enemy has a shield bar; attacks deplete the shield bar first"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:53
msgid "护盾条为0后，⻆⾊进⼊易伤状态，受到更多伤害，可以被击倒"
msgstr "When the shield bar reaches 0, the character enters a vulnerability state, takes more damage, and can be knocked down"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:54
msgid "⼀段时间后护盾⾃动充满"
msgstr "Shield automatically recharges after a period of time"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:56
msgid "方案5：类Clash Royale"
msgstr "Plan 5: Clash Royale Style"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:58
msgid "玩点类似Clash Royale"
msgstr "Gameplay similar to Clash Royale"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:59
msgid "选择出战的⻆⾊和位置"
msgstr "Select characters and positions for battle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:60
msgid "⽬标：⻆⾊AI和特性适合当前战场情况"
msgstr "Objective: Character AI and traits suit the current battlefield situation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:61
msgid "特性：AOE能⼒强，单体输出⾼，控制多"
msgstr "Traits: Strong AOE ability, high single-target damage, abundant crowd control"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:62
msgid ""
"AI：⽐较复杂，有些是打最近的怪，有些是打⾎最多的。⻆⾊还会主动跑开，躲避敌⼈的技能。某些⻆⾊技能需要蓄⼒，那就⾯临蓄⼒完成但是被打 "
"还是中断蓄⼒跑开的选择。"
msgstr ""
"AI: Relatively complex. Some target the nearest enemy, some target the one with the most HP. "
"Characters may also actively run away to dodge enemy skills. Some character skills require charging, "
"creating a choice between completing the charge and risking being hit, or interrupting the charge to dodge."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:63
msgid "例⼦"
msgstr "Examples"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:64
msgid "看到⼀堆⼩怪上AOE⻆⾊，看到⾼甲怪上单体⻆⾊，看到灵活的怪上控制型⻆⾊"
msgstr "Use AOE characters against groups of small enemies, single-target characters against heavily armored enemies, and crowd control characters against agile enemies"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:65
msgid "训练"
msgstr "Training"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:66
msgid "多种情景"
msgstr "Multiple Scenarios"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:67
msgid "1个⼤boss，如何连招，从哪开始攻击"
msgstr "1 large boss: how to combo, where to start attacking"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:68
msgid "多个⼩怪，⾛位和技能释放"
msgstr "Multiple small enemies: positioning and skill usage"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:69
msgid "两边都来怪，是打还是跑，打的话打哪⼀类⽬标？"
msgstr "Enemies coming from both sides: fight or flee? If fighting, which type of target to prioritize?"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:70
msgid "AI差异"
msgstr "AI Differences"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:71
msgid "连招顺序"
msgstr "Combo Order"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:72
msgid "⽬标优先级"
msgstr "Target Priority"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:73
msgid "结合战⽃和训练"
msgstr "Combining Battle and Training"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:74
msgid "避免训练量过⼤"
msgstr "Avoiding Excessive Training Volume"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:75
msgid "战⽃中可以点击⻆⾊下达指令"
msgstr "During battle, players can click on characters to issue commands"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience.md:76
msgid "每场战⽃完毕后，为⻆⾊进⾏评价"
msgstr "After each battle, evaluate the characters' performance"
